import RMF.UniformLower.HP2WindowExt.Cells

/-!
# Numerals for HP2's window integral with the rest: the deep cells `160 ≤ j < 165`

Generated by a script.

Per cell the bound on the rest's damped cosine integral (`RMF.IsRestCosBound`) and the
weight `e^{2B_j + 10⁻¹⁹ - j/40} ≤ w_j`; `RMF/UniformLower/HP2WindowExtNum/Deep3.lean`
collects them.
